<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritian rupee strengthes against dollar.</title>
<headline>Mauritian rupee strengthes against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian ruppe strengthened slightly against the dollar and weakened against the pound sterling on Monday, reflecting international market trends.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a mean commercial rate of 21.7435 to the dollar from 21.844 on Friday and at 35.0855 to the pound from 34.787.</p>
</text>
